OL,3,GNEWSAOff-road biker who deliberately
OL,4,Ahit woman jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn off-road motorbike rider who badly
OL,7,Finjured a woman when he deliberately
OL,8,Fstruck her in Aberdeen has been jailed.
OL,10,FBrian Noble, 44, drove at the
OL,11,F29-year-old woman after she challenged
OL,12,Fhim about the manner of his riding.
OL,14,FHe struck her with his arm as he went
OL,15,Fpast, in the city's Ramsay Crescent in
OL,16,FMay this year. The woman was thrown to
OL,17,Fthe ground and lost consciousness.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
